---
title: Feedback
description: Tell me what I should stop, start or continue to do.
---
<p>Thanks for working with me. Your feedback helps me grow.</p>
<p>Add your name or be anonymous. Your answers are emailed to me; they are not stored on this website.</p>

<form class="site-form" method="post" action="/api/form">
  <input type="hidden" name="form" value="feedback">
  <fieldset>
    <legend>Where did we work together?</legend>
    {%- for place in workedOn %}
    <label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="where" value="{{ place }}" required> {{ place }}</label>
    {%- endfor %}
    <label class="choice"><input type="radio" name="where" value="Other"> Somewhere else</label>
    <label for="where_other" class="sub-label">If somewhere else, where?</label>
    <input type="text" id="where_other" name="where_other" maxlength="200">
  </fieldset>

  <label for="feedback">What should I stop, start or continue to do, please?</label>
  <textarea id="feedback" name="feedback" rows="6" maxlength="5000" required></textarea>

  <label for="name">Your name <span class="hint">(optional)</span></label>
  <input type="text" id="name" name="name" maxlength="200" autocomplete="name">

  <div class="trap" aria-hidden="true">
    <label for="website">Leave this empty</label>
    <input type="text" id="website" name="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off">
  </div>

  {% include "human-check.njk" %}

  <button type="submit">Send feedback</button>
</form>
